# Line endings are LF in the repository and in every checkout, including on
# Windows. The app is Windows-only, but generated artifacts (the OpenAPI
# spec, locale JSON, translation files) and the web linter compare bytes;
# CRLF checkouts made the spec check and Prettier fail on Windows while
# passing everywhere else, and risk whole-file diffs for Windows editors.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary assets (git would normally detect these, but be explicit).
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.mp4 binary
*.png binary
*.webp binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
